<title>USA: Toni Braxton wins female vocalist Grammy.</title>
<headline>Toni Braxton wins female vocalist Grammy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhythm and blues diva Toni Braxton on Wednesday won a Grammy Award, the U.S. music industry's top honour, for her hit song &quot;Un-Break My Heart.&quot;</p>
<p>Braxton also won a Grammy as best female R&amp;B vocalist for her song &quot;You're Makin' Me High&quot; in a private awards ceremony that preceded the televised awards show.</p>
</text>
